left open, I peeked in.

1065
01:25:27,972 --> 01:25:29,455
And no one was
watching me

1066
01:25:30,181 --> 01:25:32,555
because I never really had
a proper babysitter.

1067
01:25:33,930 --> 01:25:35,450
It was usually just

1068
01:25:36,775 --> 01:25:40,723
one of the girls on
set or a make-up artist

1069
01:25:41,436 --> 01:25:44,519
that would look after me when my
parents were doing a scene, but…

1070
01:25:45,389 --> 01:25:47,014
I remember the sounds.

1071
01:25:47,588 --> 01:25:49,896
It used to make me
think that my mum

1072
01:25:50,711 --> 01:25:52,391
was in some sort of pain.

1073
01:26:02,180 --> 01:26:05,347
I should probably keep this
kind of stuff to myself, right?

1074
01:26:23,930 --> 01:26:25,805
- I'll see you tomorrow.
- Yeah, see ya.

1075
01:26:35,180 --> 01:26:36,430
Wait, Alec.

1076
01:26:42,472 --> 01:26:44,055
I fucked up.

1077
01:26:44,930 --> 01:26:46,680
It shouldn't get between us.

1078
01:26:51,939 --> 01:26:54,305
You're the most
important thing in my life.

1079
01:26:56,264 --> 01:26:58,014
No mucking about.

1080
01:27:01,722 --> 01:27:02,847
Here.

1081
01:27:05,908 --> 01:27:06,908
Hi.

1082
01:27:23,222 --> 01:27:24,555
I want that.

1083
01:28:11,472 --> 01:28:12,722
Ow, wait!

1084
01:28:12,805 --> 01:28:14,055
What's that?

1085
01:28:15,097 --> 01:28:16,764
Oh. Oh, shit.

1086
01:28:16,847 --> 01:28:18,055
Sorry.

1087
01:28:54,180 --> 01:28:55,514
Look at me.

1088
01:28:59,889 --> 01:29:01,389
I love looking at you.

1089
01:29:10,389 --> 01:29:11,389
Here.

1090
01:29:20,930 --> 01:29:22,264
Close your eyes.

1091
01:29:25,639 --> 01:29:27,347
Just trust me.

1092
01:29:28,180 --> 01:29:29,389
OK.

1093
01:29:51,347 --> 01:29:53,139
Can I open them?

1094
01:30:00,791 --> 01:30:02,041
Nina?

1095
01:31:05,680 --> 01:31:07,988
That's what it feels like
when you won't look at me.

1096
01:31:11,555 --> 01:31:14,805
We're in the same room, but
I feel like you're just not there.

1097
01:32:38,813 --> 01:32:39,813
Just

1098
01:32:40,297 --> 01:32:41,472
do it really slowly.

1099
01:32:42,764 --> 01:32:43,902
OK.

1100
01:32:50,097 --> 01:32:51,097
Wait.

1101
01:34:18,889 --> 01:34:20,472
Wait, is that recording?

1102
01:34:21,722 --> 01:34:22,851
Fuck.

1103
01:34:22,875 --> 01:34:23,905
Did you turn it on?

1104
01:34:23,930 --> 01:34:25,055
No.

1105
01:34:27,264 --> 01:34:29,764
You must have, when you
sat on it, do you remember?

1106
01:34:29,847 --> 01:34:31,347
Oh, shit!

1107
01:34:31,847 --> 01:34:34,055
It doesn't matter,
we can erase it.

1108
01:34:38,847 --> 01:34:39,972
Shit.

1109
01:34:39,997 --> 01:34:40,997
Alec

1110
01:34:41,465 --> 01:34:43,137
come and give
us a hand, will you?

1111
01:34:43,972 --> 01:34:46,264
- I'll be right back.
- OK.

1112
01:35:03,889 --> 01:35:05,222
Hey, man.

1113
01:35:09,305 --> 01:35:11,339
Amy's coming down tomorrow

1114
01:35:11,886 --> 01:35:13,037
with a new bird.

1115
01:35:13,680 --> 01:35:15,514
What do you reckon, about 4:30?

1116
01:35:17,389 --> 01:35:18,930
I know it's tight
with school, but…

1117
01:35:22,514 --> 01:35:24,222
Nothing freaky this time.

1118
01:35:25,805 --> 01:35:27,680
I promise you, just regular.

1119
01:35:36,305 --> 01:35:38,097
I'm not doing this any more.

1120
01:35:46,014 --> 01:35:47,087
I know.

1121
01:36:10,680 --> 01:36:12,347
Are you watching it?

1122
01:36:13,555 --> 01:36:15,972
No, I was trying to
figure out how to erase it.

1123
01:36:20,347 --> 01:36:22,014
Do you want to watch it?

1124
01:36:37,514 --> 01:36:39,305
<i>- Are you OK?
- Yeah.</i>

1125
01:36:39,930 --> 01:36:42,680
<i>Just do it really slowly.</i>

1126
01:36:44,139 --> 01:36:45,264
<i>OK.</i>

1127
01:37:37,389 --> 01:37:39,180
That wasn't…

1128
01:37:41,683 --> 01:37:42,683
It didn't

1129
01:37:43,178 --> 01:37:45,139
look like
anything it felt like.

1130
01:37:47,514 --> 01:37:49,222
I mean, it was good.

1131
01:37:52,555 --> 01:37:54,514
For you, too, was it?

1132
01:37:56,055 --> 01:37:57,145
I mean…

1133
01:37:57,704 --> 01:37:59,215
a lot of it was.

1134
01:38:00,180 --> 01:38:01,972
The start was really nice.

1135
01:38:06,264 --> 01:38:07,472
Really?

1136
01:38:08,389 --> 01:38:09,597
Really.

1137
01:38:31,805 --> 01:38:33,180
Hold on.
